<blockquote>
<p>which takes place over the span of five years.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Is this intended to have no line breaks?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Fulfill your purpose&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Is this intended to not have a period?</p>
<p>In general I think the piece is describing the shape of a narrative, but the SCP Foundation format doesn't really lend itself to hinting at a narrative; it must actually contain one or be so compelling that it doesnt need one. It has a lot of compelling aspects to this- the letters are a lot more effective than the communication logs or the addendum of the specific effects associated with each paper. However, the conclusion is questionable overall to have led to something satisfying. I think if there was a greater overview into what is necessary towards a very specific effect impressed upon the reader, and then a sharpening of the ending towards this effect, it'll be more effective than what it is now.</p>

							</div>

